<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South African cement firms to appeal merger ruling.</title>
<headline>South African cement firms to appeal merger ruling.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha Ltd and Murray and Roberts Ltd (M&amp;R) confirmed on Friday they would appeal the Competition Board's rejection of the proposed merger of Alpha with M&amp;R's Blue Circle cement business.</p>
<p>The Board said last Friday it was not convinced the merger of Alpha and Blue Circle would be in the public interest. The final decision rests with Trade and Industry Minister Alec Erwin.</p>
<p>&quot;Alpha and M&amp;R intend making representaions to the minister in order to demonstrate the benefits of the merger to the cement industry, the consumer and the general public,&quot; the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The companies first announced in June that they planned to merge.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
